stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Closed
    Closed --> All: Open deal
    All --> Outstanding: Select Outstanding requirements
    Outstanding --> All: Select All requirements
    All --> All: Refresh same deal succeeds
    Outstanding --> Outstanding: Refresh same deal succeeds
    All --> Unavailable: Malformed or unavailable snapshot
    Outstanding --> Unavailable: Malformed or unavailable snapshot
    Unavailable --> All: Explicit refresh succeeds with retained All selection
    Unavailable --> Outstanding: Explicit refresh succeeds with retained Outstanding selection
    All --> All: Refresh fails and shows failure status
    Outstanding --> Outstanding: Refresh fails and shows failure status
    All --> Closed: Close or switch deal
    Outstanding --> Closed: Close or switch deal
    Unavailable --> Closed: Close or switch deal
    All --> Retired: Access denied
    Outstanding --> Retired: Access denied
    Closed --> Closed: Old request completes
    Retired --> Retired: Old request completes
    %% never: Filtering changes canonical status or the full due summary.
    %% never: A retired request changes another workspace or its editor.
    %% never: Same deal refresh resets selection or expanded evidence.
